    "normalPlay": "125.848-second normal-save video reviewed via 0–125 s contact sheet every 5 s plus the full victory frame; a finite visual review, not frame-by-frame inspection or audible A/B. Seven exact extracted checkpoints retained. Actual video timestamps may precede requested times because the screen was idle.",
